<title>UK: Protean says talks on possible offer ended.</title>
<headline>Protean says talks on possible offer ended.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British water purification and scientific equipment manufacturer Protean Plc said on Thursday it had received an unsolicited approach that could have led to a possible takeover offer but that talks had now ended.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
